{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleveland Hopkins International Airport (KCLE) is a significant commercial airport, being the\u00a0 largest and busiest airport in the state,  developed by FeelThere for Tower! Simulator 3. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Airport</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleveland Hopkins International serves as the primary airport for the city of Cleveland, Ohio, and functions as a hub for several airlines.  The airport features three runways, four concourses, three of which are currently in use and a modern terminal building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734640/extras/4.jpg?t=1747154521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interesting Facts:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The longest runway (06R/24L) measures 3,048 meters and can accommodate all aircraft types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was the first airport with an air traffic control tower and a two-level design separating arrivals from departures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The terminal building was completely modernized in 2016 and features a unique glass facade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleveland\u00a0proudly claims the title of being the birthplace of Superman</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734640?t=1747154521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734640/029b2fc9dc3988f19658c6dc4b0a4222a2949e19/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747154521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734640/1a0d91b58aac501dcab27facc60d7da0fe79eca6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747154521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734640/1a0d91b58aac501dcab27facc60d7da0fe79eca6/capsule_184x69.